 "title": "阅卷机",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 93.38,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "零知识证明，是让验证者相信一个计算结果正确，不用自己重算，也看不到计算的秘密输入。",
   "spoken": "零知识证明，是让验证者相信一个计算结果正确，不用自己虫算，也看不到计算的秘密输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 7.776,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 10.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "要证明的计算，先写成一组数学约束，叫电路。",
   "spoken": "要证明的计算，先写成一组数学约束，叫电路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.048,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 12.146,
   "speechEnd": 16.169
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "满足全部约束的输入，才算正确。",
   "spoken": "满足全部约束的输入，才算正确。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 17.236,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 17.334,
   "speechEnd": 19.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "证明器在链下，按电路生成证明。",
   "spoken": "证明器在链下，按电路生成证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.936,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 21.034,
   "speechEnd": 23.986
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "验证器在链上，检查证明是不是满足这个电路。",
   "spoken": "验证器在链上，检查证明是不是满足这个电路。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.044,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 25.142,
   "speechEnd": 28.856
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "有些方案，开工前要先做一次可信设置，生成证明用的参数。",
   "spoken": "有些方案，开工前要先做一次可信设置，生成证明用的参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 29.92,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 30.018,
   "speechEnd": 34.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "最后，业务合约按证明里的公开输入，去结算。",
   "spoken": "最后，业务合约按证明里的公开输入，去结算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.708,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 35.806,
   "speechEnd": 39.413
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "电路、设置、证明器、验证器、结算，任何一环都可能出错。",
   "spoken": "电路、设置、证明器、验证器、结算，任何一环都可能出错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.464,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 40.562,
   "speechEnd": 46.526
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.596,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 47.694,
   "speechEnd": 48.479
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "考试的阅卷机，只核对答题卡上的格子，是不是按规则涂满。",
   "spoken": "考试的阅倦机，只核对答题卡上的格子，是不是按规则涂满。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 49.688,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 49.786,
   "speechEnd": 54.155
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "如果出题人漏写了一条，第 5 题只能涂一个格子。",
   "spoken": "如果出题人漏写了一条，第 5 题只能涂一个格子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 55.212,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 55.31,
   "speechEnd": 58.702
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "考生把第 5 题的 4 个格子全涂上，阅卷机照样判对。",
   "spoken": "考生把第 5 题的 4 个格子全涂上，阅倦机照样判对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.776,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 59.874,
   "speechEnd": 63.897
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "阅卷机没坏，是规则漏了一条。",
   "spoken": "阅倦机没坏，是规则漏了一条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 64.964,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 65.062,
   "speechEnd": 67.502
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的电路有成千上万条约束。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的电路有成千上万条约束。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.568,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 68.666,
   "speechEnd": 72.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "漏写一条，从外面看不出任何异常，只能靠审计、形式化验证和测试去找。",
   "spoken": "漏写一条，从外面看不出任何异常，只能靠审计、形式化验证和测试去找。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 73.924,
   "dur": 6.984,
   "speechStart": 74.022,
   "speechEnd": 80.081
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "所以记住一句话。",
   "spoken": "所以记住一句话。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 81.128,
   "dur": 2.112,
   "speechStart": 81.226,
   "speechEnd": 82.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "验证器只检查证明是否满足电路，不检查电路是否写对。",
   "spoken": "验证器只检查证明是否满足电路，不检查电路是否写对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 83.46,
   "dur": 5.544,
   "speechStart": 83.558,
   "speechEnd": 88.165
  },
  {
